$prompts_to_texts — move prompts into texts

SUMMARY
  Copies content from each prompts[] link into texts[] (one file per prompt,
  or a single joined file). Clears prompts[] afterward. Used to feed lyrics
  or plain text into $music (texts[] = lyrics) or other text consumers.

SYNTAX
  $prompts_to_texts
  $prompts_to_texts(join=1)

INPUT
  prompts[] — source strings.

OUTPUT
  texts[] — new links with the same text content.
  prompts[] — cleared.

ARGUMENTS
  join=1 | true | yes — merge all prompts into one texts[] entry (\\n\\n separated).

EXAMPLE
  @lyrics_texts: @lyrics -> $prompts_to_texts

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  Yes.
